From 54941f2c7dba611749afc6ede752c71b67de86ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:17:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Gateways: Nares, Jones and Barrow sections; daily ice output;
 CAA rerun

Three Canadian Archipelago sections (Kennedy Channel, Jones Sound, Barrow
Strait) join the gateway lines, so gateways.csv and glorys_gateways_native.jl
give model and GLORYS transports through them; the GLORYS Arctic budget still
uses only Fram, BSO, Bering and Davis. Coupled runs write daily ice thickness
and concentration to nested_ice.jld2. plot_gateways.jl prints 10-day means of
the three channels, their sum and Davis. runs/tsubouchi-2005-15km-fullcell-caa-2mo.toml
reruns the whole-cell Sep-Oct 2005 run with these diagnostics.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvpBQdtxRS1ZtXrmX6a
